ce web de mise &#x000e0; jour en temps r&#x000e9;el de cubes SOLAP</article-title><source>MSc Thesis</source><year>2008</year><publisher-name>Universit&#x000e9; Laval, Department of geomatics sciences</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B31"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kimball</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Merz</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><source>The Microsoft Data Warehouse Toolkit: With SQL Server 2005 and the Microsoft Business Intelligence Toolset</source><year>2006</year><publisher-name>John Wiley &#x00026; Sons</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B32"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Badard</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Dub&#x000e9;</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Using open source to spatially enable. Business Intelligence (BI) applications</article-title><source>OS BootCamp 6/GeoCamp 2008 Ottawa, Ontario, Canada, June 2&#x02013;3, 2008</source><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://geosoa.scg.ulaval.ca"/></citation></ref><ref id="B33"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Levesque</surname><given-names>M-A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Approche formelle pour une meilleure identification et gestion des risques d'usages inappropri&#x000e9;s des donn&#x000e9;es g&#x000e9;od&#x000e9;cisionnelles</article-title><source>MSc Thesis</source><year>2008</year><publisher-name>Universit&#x000e9; Laval, Department of geomatics sciences</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B34"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Levesque</surname><given-names>M-A</given-names></name><name><surname>B&#x000e9;dard</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Gervais</surname><given-names>M<